  "tips": "Try to find the most restrictive constraints first, like a large sum or a single cell with a high target. Always look for doubles like [4,4] when you see an equals region that covers two cells of the same domino. If you get stuck, look at your list of unused dominoes and see which ones are the most unique, like those containing a 0 or a 6.",
